# price_check.py gates FLAT meters. This week's exposure is Analytics
# ingestion at $2.76/GB, because the whole point is turning logging ON.
# So the bound is in Terraform instead: daily_quota_gb = 0.5, and a
# predicted volume written into meters.json BEFORE deploying, so the
# measurement can contradict it.
